{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026YiDi8criiN1795575810.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>財政司司長陳茂波，繼續英國訪問行程。</p><p></p><p>陳茂波率領代表團，當地星期二出席香港歐洲商務委員會會議。他致辭時介入本港經濟情況，指出口及消費等錄得增長，加上首個五年規劃，為企業來港投資提供確定性。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.FS-1030.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026GDgg3BbZml1795575807.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>他之後拜會中國駐英大使鄭澤光，並出席香港工商協會午餐會，提出港英創科四大合作方向，包括鼓勵當地大學到北都設校園，以及在河套進行跨境臨床試驗。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.FS-1030_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026YSvQxTdI6d1795575804.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>出席數字資產圓桌會議，探討兩地金融機構合作空間，又出席貿發局舉辦的晚宴，指香港與倫敦可加強離岸人民幣及黃金交易合作。</p><p></p><p>陳茂波及代表團，之後轉往荷蘭繼續行程。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T03:23:54.165189+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":244,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T02:21:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T04:37:15.410167+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T03:17:18.078279+00:00","content_hash":"3972f075aad405d2859eeebb1c5019acad6f3bc6f2f970ffe4a3aad696b9c363","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}